    "description": "# RF-4: Player Cross-Reference\n\n_Cross-reference fields linking a Referrer to their Player record, when the same person is both._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Related Player Record — Lookup to Player\n\n* Cross-reference only, never merges the two records.\n\n* Player Status — Formula, read-only\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Active Operators removed from this field list\n\n* Joyce Kiddell, [1:37:08](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5828): \"...And then player record, so the same, like, on the flip side of what we saw. Remove active operators...\"\n\n* \"Convert Player to Referrer\" screen-flow is a Phase 2 candidate, not this build\n\n* Emily Vandenberg, [1:42:37](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6157): \"This is probably like a down the line request...\" Kobi Kunasekaran, [1:42:57](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6177): \"we could set up a screen flow that essentially pre-fills those fields from the player record.\"\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-4 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-4 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 1:37:08 (Active Operators removed)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5828)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Emily Vandenberg, 1:42:37 (Phase 2 candidate)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6157)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 1:42:57 (screen-flow concept)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6177)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/), [BUILD-173 — Player: Core Details fields](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217684264652851/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
